.vercel
.env*

# ── One-off operational artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Rollback snapshots and backups written by the maintenance scripts. They are
# point-in-time dumps of production rows, not source.
#
# pending-orders-backup-*.json in particular contains customer emails, phone
# numbers and shipping addresses. Committing it would put customer PII into
# git history permanently, where it cannot be removed without rewriting every
# clone. Ignored so that cannot happen by accident.
*-rollback-*.json
*-rollback.json
pending-orders-backup-*.json
attribute-backfill-rollback-*.json
work-attribute-rollback-*.json
work-correction-rollback-*.json
image-audit.csv
image-*-manifest.json
.vscode/
